@startuml
actor "校园App用户" as user
participant "图片内容浏览" as homePage
database "系统DB" as systemRecords
participant "系统" as system

activate user
user -> homePage: 进入App首页界面
activate homePage

user -> homePage: 选择图片内容分类
homePage -> system: 用户选择分类请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 获取所选分类下的所有图片内容
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 图片内容列表结果
deactivate systemRecords

user -> homePage: 选择排序方式
homePage -> system: 用户选择排序方式请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 根据排序方式重新展示图片内容列表
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 重新排序后的图片内容列表结果
deactivate systemRecords

user -> homePage: 浏览和查看图片内容详细信息

user -> homePage: 点击收藏按钮
homePage -> system: 用户收藏图片内容请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 将图片内容添加到用户收藏夹
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 添加收藏结果
deactivate systemRecords

deactivate user
deactivate system
@enduml
